{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And the money failed from the land of Egypt and from the land of Canaan, and all Egypt came to Joseph, etc.</b> He mentioned that the money failed from the land of Canaan, because when the Egyptians came to Joseph they would remind him of this, for they would say: Now that the money has failed also from the land of Canaan and they will no longer come to you to buy, why should we die before you, since the money is gone, and let us die for nothing, and the grain will remain in your hand with no buyer."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:45:56.090308241Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}